# --- Reka bentuk hardware: iterasi yang sudah digantikan ---
# Folder hardware_design_v1/ diasingkan ikut versi: v1/ .. v10/ (model + render + skrip
# penjana versi itu), figures/ (blueprint, wiring, layout), sheets/ (helaian 4 panel).
# Skrip .py setiap versi masuk repo (kecil, itu sejarah sebenar); binari berat kekal di disk.
# Hanya set semasa (v10) binari di-commit. Lihat Week05.../hardware_design_v1/README.md.
Week05_26Oct-01Nov/Output/hardware_design_v1/v[1-9]/*.blend
Week05_26Oct-01Nov/Output/hardware_design_v1/v[1-9]/*.glb
Week05_26Oct-01Nov/Output/hardware_design_v1/v[1-9]/*.obj
Week05_26Oct-01Nov/Output/hardware_design_v1/v[1-9]/*.mtl
Week05_26Oct-01Nov/Output/hardware_design_v1/v[1-9]/render_*.png
Week05_26Oct-01Nov/Output/hardware_design_v1/sheets/sheet_hardware_design_v1.png

